{"slug":"keith-ellison","qid":"Q40589","name":"Keith Ellison","desc":"American politician (born 1963)","article":"Keith Ellison","born":"1963-08-04","died":null,"birthplace":"Detroit","parties":["Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party","Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"Minnesota Attorney General","w":"","f":2019,"u":null},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"MN-05","f":2007,"u":2019},{"t":"Minnesota House of Representatives","w":"","f":2003,"u":2006}],"summary":"Keith Maurice Ellison (born August 4, 1963) is an American politician and lawyer serving as the 30th attorney general of Minnesota since 2019. From 2007 to 2019, Ellison was the U.S. representative for Minnesota's 5th congressional district, representing the Minneapolis region. He also served as Deputy Chair of the Democratic National Committee from 2017 to 2018 and was a member of the Minnesota House of Representatives from 2003 to 2007.","photo":{"f":"keith-ellison.jpg","by":"US House Office of Photography","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Keith_Ellison_portrait.jpg"},"history":[{"y":2026,"o":"A","k":"MN-AG","p":"D","n":"Keith Ellison","race":"MN-AG"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"MN-05","p":"D","v":249957,"s":69.07,"w":true,"n":"Keith Ellison"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"MN-05","p":"D","v":167079,"s":70.79,"w":true,"n":"Keith Ellison"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"MN-05","p":"D","v":262102,"s":74.47,"w":true,"n":"Keith Ellison"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"MN-05","p":"D","v":154833,"s":67.66,"w":true,"n":"Keith Ellison"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"MN-05","p":"D","v":228776,"s":70.88,"w":true,"n":"Keith Ellison"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"MN-05","p":"D","v":136060,"s":55.56,"w":true,"n":"Keith Ellison"}]}